	<section_number>15.2-2617</section_number>
	<catch_line>Sale of bonds</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any locality may sell any bonds authorized under the provisions of this chapter in such manner, either at public or private sale, and for such price as the governing body of the locality may determine.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 15-666.46; 1958, c. 640; 1962, c. 623, § 15.1-205; 1991, c. 668, § 15.1-227.19; 1997, c. 587.</history>
